/// last Tuesday, across all drafts"). It is the WRONG shape here, and the first GIVEN/THEN is what
/// proves it: a brand-new draft has no revisions, so a one-row-per-revision view has no row for it at
/// all, and a screen reading that view shows nothing for a draft that certainly exists.
/// </summary>
